title: "Zabbix MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server for Zabbix 6.0-7.4 (monitoring): hosts, host groups, templates, items, triggers, problems and events, history and trends, maintenance, users, proxies, SLAs, script execution and configuration import/export. Read-only mode, tag-based tool filtering and rate limiting."
